{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"The spacing of stimulation trains and insertion of stimulation pauses with TBS-DBS might represent a double-edged sword for DBS application.\",\n    \"The finding of impaired, short-term efficacy in tremor suppression by non-continuous DBS was interpreted as the inability to mask burst-driver inputs to the thalamus.\",\n    \"This might partially explain the slightly inferior short-term effect on objective gait parameters and the FoG-Course of TBS-DBS as a whole group compared to cDBS.\",\n    \"TBS-DBS with its temporal patterning might slowly, progressively increase its subthalamic efficacy in the long-term by beneficial neuroplastic effects from TBS-DBS.\",\n    \"Since axial symptoms might change over days, the EEG might potentially point to advantageous long-term changes, which could not be proven in that acute experimental setting.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"The primary outcome, the relative change of FoG-Course by DBS, was not superior with TBS-DBS compared to cDBS in the entire sample.\",\n    \"The comparison of the relative DBS–induced change in the FoG-Course from OFF-DBS in the entire sample revealed slightly better effects of cDBS compared to TBS-DBS (Wilcoxon signed rank test p = 0.039).\",\n    \"In this study, we found no superior effects of TBS-DBS compared to cDBS for the FoG-Course or the MDS-UPDRS III in the entirety of the group.\",\n    \"4 PD participants rated TBS better (4 PD participants), equal (3 PD participants) or worse (8 PD participants) compared to cDBS.\",\n    \"For the exploration of the full effect strength, a long-term evaluation of TBS-DBS would be necessary, which has not been performed here in the randomised study of short-term effects.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告所述机制并非凭空提出。论文第Discussion部分明确讨论了TBS-DBS暂停可能导致的即时刺激遮蔽不足，以及由此产生的短期疗效劣势；同时明确提出长期神经可塑性可能逐渐增强TBS-DBS疗效的假说。因此，这些机制具有直接全文依据。不过，跨日适应机制需要限定：论文仅指出轴性症状可能随时间（数天）变化，并未建立或验证一个明确的跨日适应机制。此外，附件只有论文全文，没有被指控的研究报告本身，因而无法独立核实报告第6.9节是否确实遗漏或没有系统呈现主要结果，不能将这一点判定为全文明确支持。指控者对论文临床结果的描述则有明确依据：第一，主要结局没有显示TBS-DBS在全体患者中优于cDBS；第二，主要FoG-Course相对变化比较中，cDBS效果略好（p=0.039）；第三，15名患者中4名评价TBS-DBS更好、3名评价相等、8名评价更差，所谓TBS-preference group实际包含评价相等者，不能将7人全部理解为明确偏好TBS；第四，作者明确说明本研究没有进行长期疗效评价。还应注意，论文另报告全样本Friedman事后比较中TBS-DBS与cDBS没有显著差异，因此cDBS略好这一结论应限定于主要相对变化比较。总体而言，指控者对原文主要临床结果和研究局限的概述成立；但报告提出机制假说本身并不构成误读，是否遗漏临床结果还需要查看报告原文才能最终确认。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "01624b4a-421a-425d-aac9-a708297e4cff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T070612680324Z", "elapsed_seconds": 161.907, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:08:54.593651+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "507c31eace08d46d4d3204003fae2ec9bfa3a47f52fc9d8df29541372e792b4b", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T070612680324Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "60840ca8efcf9cbd9e7acce4d4a998c6df78eafe8793904219f30aa8941eb8c8"}}}
